  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cab4b236dccbed2",
      "translationZh": "安装/下载 llama.cpp、Freecad、你最喜欢的 gguf 模型——最好具备多媒体图像读取能力（我使用的是由 Unsloth 量化的 Qwen3.8-27B-UD-Q4_K_M 和配套的 mmproj-F16）、uv（、pi.dev）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a75bd6f8b9c879a",
      "translationZh": "cd /your/path/to/（即安装位置）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91a7ba79fbdf352f",
      "translationZh": "如果使用 pi 编程智能体作为建模助手，请写入文件 ~/.pi/agent/mcp.json：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de527de1a51009b9",
      "translationZh": "如果使用 llama-server 作为建模助手，请写入一个名为 freecad_mcp.json 的文件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "348d6b600f022ca9",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5.1（使用 pi 作为建模智能体）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3686f1f3a7a4187",
      "translationZh": "运行 pi，然后在 pi 中输入以下命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "96ad7c93b77dbe16",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5.2（将 llama server 用作建模智能体）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08785a71d3cf7603",
      "translationZh": "像往常一样启动 llama-server，并添加选项 --mcp-servers-config /your/path/to/freecad_mcp.json",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a61ab262d8ea812",
      "translationZh": "确认在 llama-server 的 webui > Settings > Tools > Server 下可以找到 freecad_* 工具，必要时允许它们无需请求许可即可运行；另外，在 webui > Settings > Agentic > Agentic turns 下，将该值增加到类似 99 的数值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7c5903195fac17a",
      "translationZh": "像往常一样启动 llama-server；如果模型具有多媒体能力，还需添加用于加载视觉附加组件的选项：--mmproj name_of_the_mmproj.gguf，以便本地模型读取 freecad 的截图，并验证已执行的几何操作是否正确",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a6da73af9498218",
      "translationZh": "启动 Freecad，选择“MCP Add-on”工作台，点击“Start RPC Server”和/或“Auto-Start Server”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cbd01f9c1103d26",
      "translationZh": "在 Freecad 中创建一个新文档",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d0f0b6c91f70d61d",
      "translationZh": "步骤 8：在 llama server 的 webui 或 pi 中输入类似下面的提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "832285b09357d916",
      "translationZh": "在 freecad 中生成一个立方体，里面有一个从顶部贯穿到底部的五角星形孔",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dde508f1dfbe8392",
      "translationZh": "或者，作为所发布图片的起点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90ffee1d092fc56e",
      "translationZh": "在 freecad 中创建一个名为 \"double smooth gears\" 的新项目。在这个项目中设计 2 个相同的齿轮，每个齿轮各有 20 根辐条，一个齿轮的辐条可以与另一个齿轮的辐条紧密接触，使两个齿轮相对彼此旋转和反向旋转。辐条的“峰”必须是圆滑的，相应的辐条“谷”也应同样圆滑；类似于沿圆形路径分布的正弦曲线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62c3106ccbd73331",
      "translationZh": "玩得开心，未来才刚刚开始",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fbc97307c282b9f",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/DevelopmentBorn3978 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
